  "system": {
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements:</strong> Training (1) in Melee Weapons</p><p>You know how to pin an opponent down and strike them in the back when they try to flee.</p><p>Once per turn, when a creature attempts to move out of your <strong>Melee</strong> range, you can make a <strong>Melee</strong> attack against that creature as a <strong>Free Action</strong>.</p><p>This only works if the creature moves willingly, and does not apply to forced movement or effects that would move the creature.</p>",
